@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@northside = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@southside = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222
@northsideEvent = aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa
@southsideEvent = bbbbbbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Northside events
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events
X-Organisation-Id: {{northside}}

### Own event
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events/{{northsideEvent}}
X-Organisation-Id: {{northside}}

### Foreign event -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events/{{southsideEvent}}
X-Organisation-Id: {{northside}}

### Create booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/events/{{northsideEvent}}/bookings
X-Organisation-Id: {{northside}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alex Wong",
  "email": "alex@example.com"
}

### List bookings
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/events/{{northsideEvent}}/bookings
X-Organisation-Id: {{northside}}
